# Build context exclusions for every Dockerfile in docker/.
# Keeps contexts small and, critically, prevents host state from leaking
# into images: host node_modules (wrong platform / stale), local SQLite
# data, playwright artifacts, build outputs.

# VCS / metadata
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky

# Dependencies (installed inside the images)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Local runtime state - never bake into an image
packages/server/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Build artifacts (rebuilt inside the images)
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/.vite
coverage
**/coverage
storybook-static
*.storybook.log
test-results
playwright-report
.biome-cache

# Docs / plans not needed to build or test
docs
plans
LICENSE
README.md
